### 여행 생성 (Create Trip)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "제주 여행",
  "thumbnail": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
  "destination": "제주도",
  "tripStatus": "PLANNED",
  "startDate": "2025-11-01",
  "endDate": "2025-11-03",
  "totalDuration": 3
}

### 여행 목록 조회 (Get Trips)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips?userId=1&startDate=2025-11-01&endDate=2025-11-30

### 특정 여행 조회 (Get Trip by ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1?userId=1

### 여행 수정 (Update Trip)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "제주 여행 수정",
  "thumbnail": "https://example.com/image2.jpg",
  "destination": "제주도",
  "tripStatus": "PLANNED",
  "startDate": "2025-11-02",
  "endDate": "2025-11-04",
  "totalDuration": 3
}

### 여행 삭제 (Delete Trip)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1?userId=1


